This generates a single, centered line displaying how many calls your
BBS has received to date and how long it's been in operation.

I've placed the following text on line #29 of my bbstext, but you'll
probably have to play around with the placement in your own.  Just try
it out and see how it goes.

{#0PFiles:IntroStats}

The above { is actually a control-Q commands and remember to modify the
path to where you placed the "IntroStats" script.

Also, I've left this one uncompiled so you can play around with it,
modify it to suit.  Have fun...
